    {
      "id": "b1_u08_l2_g3",
      "pattern": "'ㄷ' 불규칙",
      "meaning_uz": "ㄷ bilan tugaydigan ba'zi fe'llar: ㄷ → ㄹ",
      "meaning_en": "ㄷ-irregular verbs: ㄷ → ㄹ",
      "explanation_md": "Ba'zi **ㄷ** bilan tugaydigan fe'llarda, **unli bilan boshlanuvchi** qo'shimcha oldidan **ㄷ → ㄹ** bo'ladi.\n\n**음악을 들어요.** — *Musiqa tinglayman.* (듣다 → 들어요)\n\n### Qaysi fe'llar\n\n- **듣다** → 들어요, 들었어요\n- **걷다** → 걸어요, 걸었어요\n- **묻다** → 물어요, 물었어요\n\n### O'zgarmaydigan fe'llar\n\n- **받다** → 받아요 (o'zgarmaydi)\n- **닫다** → 닫아요 (o'zgarmaydi)\n\n### Esda tuting\n\n- Undosh bilan boshlanuvchi qo'shimcha oldidan ㄷ **qoladi**: 듣**고**, 걷**고**, 듣**지만**.\n- Qaysi fe'l o'zgarishini yod olish kerak — eng ko'p uchraydigani **듣다** va **걷다**.",
      "explanation_md_en": "Some verbs ending in **ㄷ** change **ㄷ → ㄹ** before an ending that **starts with a vowel**.\n\n**음악을 들어요.** — *I listen to music.* (듣다 → 들어요)\n\n### Which verbs\n\n- **듣다** → 들어요, 들었어요\n- **걷다** → 걸어요, 걸었어요\n- **묻다** → 물어요, 물었어요\n\n### Regular ones\n\n- **받다** → 받아요 (no change)\n- **닫다** → 닫아요 (no change)\n\n### Remember\n\n- Before an ending that starts with a consonant, ㄷ **stays**: 듣**고**, 걷**고**.\n- You have to learn which verbs change — the most common are **듣다** and **걷다**.",
      "formation": [
